    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Pacific West</strong>, an old Western village cut off from the rest of the world. Here, there are no firearms... but be warned\u2014this place is filled with traitors and some pretty wild traps.<br>But who will you play as?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Sheriff</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Sheriff is the boss of the town. His job is to keep peace and order throughout Pacific West. But he must stay alert\u2014some people are out to get him.<br>Protect yourself, sabotage traps, and most importantly, lock up the town\u2019s troublemakers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801810/extras/195262c41396814119b6843a4e54080b.poster.avif?t=1754500092\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801810/extras/195262c41396814119b6843a4e54080b.webm?t=1754500092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801810/extras/195262c41396814119b6843a4e54080b.mp4?t=1754500092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Bandits</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their objective is simple: eliminate the Sheriff!<br>But first, they must avoid being caught and identified. Bandits have a series of tasks that lead to the creation of often deadly traps.<br>Stay hidden... or become master bluffers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801810/extras/fa357114f392f0ecc5c19c9da23d1785.poster.avif?t=1754500092\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801810/extras/fa357114f392f0ecc5c19c9da23d1785.webm?t=1754500092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801810/extras/fa357114f392f0ecc5c19c9da23d1785.mp4?t=1754500092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Deputies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a Deputy, your job is to prove your loyalty to the Sheriff.<br>Protect him and help uncover the parasites lurking in town.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Renegade</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A true wild card.<br>The Renegade can side with the Sheriff... or try to take his place. To do so, the Renegade must first ensure all the Bandits are imprisoned\u2014then eliminate the Sheriff and seize control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Suspicion, Betrayal, Cooperation... Will the Sheriff of Pacific West be overthrown?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Mechanics and Details</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Proximity voice chat</strong> allowing real-time conversations\u2014building trust... or betrayal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Task/Objective system</strong>:<br>Each player has missions. Bandits work to set traps. The Sheriff and his Deputies aim to sabotage them.<br>The Renegade can choose tasks that serve the good\u2014or the bad.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short or long rounds</strong>, with 4 to 8 players. Perfect for game nights with friends.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make every game a unique adventure... and find out who among your friends is the best liar\u2014or the most loyal ally.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Pacific West</strong>, an old Western village cut off from the rest of the world. Here, there are no firearms... but be warned\u2014this place is filled with traitors and some pretty wild traps.<br>But who will you play as?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Sheriff</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Sheriff is the boss of the town. His job is to keep peace and order throughout Pacific West. But he must stay alert\u2014some people are out to get him.<br>Protect yourself, sabotage traps, and most importantly, lock up the town\u2019s troublemakers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801810/extras/195262c41396814119b6843a4e54080b.poster.avif?t=1754500092\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801810/extras/195262c41396814119b6843a4e54080b.webm?t=1754500092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801810/extras/195262c41396814119b6843a4e54080b.mp4?t=1754500092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Bandits</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their objective is simple: eliminate the Sheriff!<br>But first, they must avoid being caught and identified. Bandits have a series of tasks that lead to the creation of often deadly traps.<br>Stay hidden... or become master bluffers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801810/extras/fa357114f392f0ecc5c19c9da23d1785.poster.avif?t=1754500092\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801810/extras/fa357114f392f0ecc5c19c9da23d1785.webm?t=1754500092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801810/extras/fa357114f392f0ecc5c19c9da23d1785.mp4?t=1754500092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Deputies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a Deputy, your job is to prove your loyalty to the Sheriff.<br>Protect him and help uncover the parasites lurking in town.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Renegade</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A true wild card.<br>The Renegade can side with the Sheriff... or try to take his place. To do so, the Renegade must first ensure all the Bandits are imprisoned\u2014then eliminate the Sheriff and seize control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Suspicion, Betrayal, Cooperation... Will the Sheriff of Pacific West be overthrown?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Mechanics and Details</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Proximity voice chat</strong> allowing real-time conversations\u2014building trust... or betrayal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Task/Objective system</strong>:<br>Each player has missions. Bandits work to set traps. The Sheriff and his Deputies aim to sabotage them.<br>The Renegade can choose tasks that serve the good\u2014or the bad.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short or long rounds</strong>, with 4 to 8 players. Perfect for game nights with friends.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make every game a unique adventure... and find out who among your friends is the best liar\u2014or the most loyal ally.</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "In &quot;Bandit&quot;, play as the Sheriff, a Deputy, a Renegade, or a Bandit. Bandits must eliminate the Sheriff, while he relies on allies to uncover traitors. Trust, traps, betrayal\u2026 stay sharp.",
